{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, move towards it. If reached, take it. Then process its properties and perform a task. Finally, scan for other objects.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
